  "description": "ACCDB (two Workspaces): db1 and db2 both open RW. db2 holds TableDefs (tds2), checks Count and Item('U') (3265). db1 executes CREATE TABLE U (ID PK, V) + INSERT (1, 42). db2 checks tds2.Count and Item('U') BEFORE Refresh, calls tds2.Refresh, checks Count and Item('U') AFTER Refresh, and reads SELECT * FROM U. Then db1 executes DROP TABLE U; db2 checks tds2.Count/Item('U') before and after Refresh; then closes db1 and db2. Keeps all pages at every step.",
